{"version":1,"notes":[{"topic":"news-a2aa26793f82d0d4-0","title":"奥迪新加坡特别涂装发布","text":"奥迪为新加坡大奖赛推出特别涂装，R26赛车侧箱和尾翼采用融合新加坡土生华人图案的设计，车手霍肯伯格和博托莱托的赛服也将沿用此图案。","tag":"新涂装","dimension":"visual","year":2026,"publishedAt":"2026-10-05T13:02:23.602Z","temporal":"event","status":"confirmed","related":{"drivers":["nico-hulkenberg","gabriel-bortoleto"],"teams":["audi"],"seasons":[2026],"races":["2026/17"]},"sources":[{"label":"F1 官方","url":"https://www.formula1.com/en/latest/article/gallery-audi-unveil-special-livery-for-singapore-grand-prix.5Z07QWFA7vVqCPC1jb6AIq"}],"verifiedAt":"2026-10-14","photo":{"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/championwang00/pitwall-f1/codex/editorial-news/images/0e2a27d26c967fd51bdc0dc4.webp","width":1200,"height":675,"bytes":32728,"caption":"奥迪新加坡特别涂装 · 官方照片","source":"https://www.formula1.com/en/latest/article/gallery-audi-unveil-special-livery-for-singapore-grand-prix.5Z07QWFA7vVqCPC1jb6AIq"}},{"topic":"news-32c6c7ac7d30578d-0","title":"车手们赛前兰卡威团建","text":"阿尔本、塞恩斯、拉塞尔、皮亚斯特里、博托莱托、贝尔曼和诺里斯等车手在马来西亚站前前往兰卡威进行团建，一起玩卡丁车、下棋和训练。","tag":"场外动态","dimension":"personality","year":2026,"publishedAt":"2026-10-01T15:18:32.911Z","temporal":"event","status":"confirmed","related":{"drivers":["carlos-sainz-jr","george-russell","oscar-piastri","gabriel-bortoleto","oliver-bearman","lando-norris","alexander-albon"],"teams":[],"seasons":[2026],"races":["2026/16"]},"sources":[{"label":"F1 官方","url":"https://www.formula1.com/en/latest/article/karting-chaos-cycling-tours-and-chess-inside-carlos-sainzs-f1-training-camp.3NUu7MqKEugEvgjb41pPt0"}],"verifiedAt":"2026-10-14","photo":{"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/championwang00/pitwall-f1/codex/editorial-news/images/366253e3098f0f309bcfbea9.webp","width":1200,"height":675,"bytes":167094,"caption":"车手公开动态 · 来源 F1 官方报道","source":"https://www.formula1.com/en/latest/article/karting-chaos-cycling-tours-and-chess-inside-carlos-sainzs-f1-training-camp.3NUu7MqKEugEvgjb41pPt0"}},{"topic":"news-32c6c7ac7d30578d-1","title":"拉塞尔社